  "nature": "Synthetic controls derived by hand from the recovered formulas y=Round((V-2.0)*28)+15, x=Round((B-V-(-0.5))*120)+80 with each x87 result rounded to a 64-bit significand (nearest-even) and FISTP nearest-even. They are not observations, not original-writer output and not an original runtime oracle.",
